20	Game Theory — Calculus Edition	20	Cournot Equilibrium	exact_linear	structural	With linear demand, a linear system in the quantity vector.	Linear inverse demand 𝑃= 𝑎−𝑏𝑄gives first-order conditions 𝑎−𝑏(𝑄+ 𝑞𝑖) −𝑐= 0, that is (𝐼+ 11⊤)𝑏q = (𝑎−𝑐)1 — an identity-plus-rank-one system, invertible by Sherman–Morrison in closed form.	Equilibrium becomes a rank-one-updated linear solve.	Exact linear for linear demand.
