32	Quantum Mechanics — Calculus Edition	55	Entangled State (Bell State)	exact_linear	spectral,operator,informational	A rank-two matrix in the bipartite coeﬀicient basis.	Writing the state as a coeﬀicient matrix 𝐶, product states are exactly rank 𝐶= 1 and entangled states have higher rank. The Schmidt coeﬀicients are the singular values of 𝐶, and entanglement entropy is the von Neumann entropy of 𝜎2 𝑖. Entanglement is a rank statement, and the SVD is its complete characterisation.	Entanglement is matrix rank; Schmidt decomposition is the SVD.	Exact linear. Possibly the cleanest single insight in the edition.
