79	Information Theory — Calculus Edition	38	MIMO Capacity	exact_linear	spectral,operator,informational,dynamical,parallel	A log determinant, equal to a sum over singular values.	The channel matrix’s SVD decouples the MIMO channel into parallel scalar channels with gains 𝜎2 𝑖, so capacity scales with min(𝑛𝑡, 𝑛𝑟) — the matrix’s rank. This is the single most consequential linear-algebraic result in modern communications: capacity is a rank, and antennas buy rank.	The SVD decouples the channel; capacity is a sum over singular values.	Exact linear. Capacity scaling is a rank statement.
