79	Information Theory — Calculus Edition	2	Structure: The code is literally a subspace: 𝐺’s rows are a basis, 𝐻spans the dual (null) space, and 𝐺𝐻⊤= 0.	exact_linear	variational,informational,dynamical		The code is literally a subspace: 𝐺’s rows are a basis, 𝐻spans the dual (null) space, and 𝐺𝐻⊤= 0. Decoding computes the syndrome 𝐻r⊤, which depends only on the error and not the codeword — the cleanest use of a null space in engineering.	A linear code is a subspace; syndrome decoding is a null space computation.	Exact linear. Already native.
